title: Julián Besteiro
is-pinned-card: true
tags: advisor, centrist
card-image: img/portraits/WelsOtto.jpg
view-if: wels_advisor = 1
new-page: true

= Julián Besteiro

Besteiro is the president of the <span style="color: #c00000;">**PSOE**</span> and the <span style="color: #700000;">**UGT**</span>, and the leading voice of the party's orthodox-Marxist current. A gifted organizer and parliamentarian, he counsels patience: the crisis of capitalism will run its course, and the party's task is to build the workers' consciousness, not to gamble on premature adventures.

- @clear_agenda
- @party_discipline
- @emergency_fundraising
- @money_printer
- @stimulation
- @snap_election
- @root: Return to main

@clear_agenda
title: Clear the agenda
subtitle: Removes all cards from the hand.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
on-arrival: {!
Q.advisor_action_timer = 6;
if (Q.difficulty >= 0) {
    window.dendryUI.dendryEngine.state.currentHands['main'] = [];
} else {
    window.dendryUI.dendryEngine.state.currentHands['main.main_easy'] = [];
}
!}

All items from our agenda have been cleared.

@party_discipline
title: Party Discipline
subtitle: Reduce dissent across the party.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; left_dissent -= 5; labor_dissent -= 10; center_dissent -= 10; reformist_dissent -= 10; neorevisionist_dissent -= 5

We have enforced party discipline to reduce dissent across all factions.

@emergency_fundraising
title: Emergency Fundraising
view-if: difficulty < 1
subtitle: An emergency infusion of resources.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; emergency_used += 1; industrial_psoe -= 2 if emergency_used > 1; labor_dissent += 5 if emergency_used > 1; unemployed_psoe -= 2 if emergency_used > 1; industrial_psoe -= 2 if emergency_used > 2; unemployed_psoe -= 2 if emergency_used > 2; labor_dissent += 5 if emergency_used > 2; labor_dissent += 5 if emergency_used > 2; resources += 2

[? if emergency_used <= 1: Besteiro has leveraged his standing in the party and the union to pull in donations and arrange quick loans. ?][? if emergency_used > 1 and emergency_used < 3: Discontent is brewing among the <span style="color: #c00000;">**PSOE**</span>'s rank and file over our persistent appeals for money. ?][? if emergency_used > 2: We're really scraping the barrel now—committed members are pressured into selling their valuables, while many others leave in frustration. ?]

We have gained +2 resources.

@money_printer
title: Print a PSOEillion pesetas.
view-if: achievement_moly and ((difficulty == -1 and not dynamic_mode) or difficulty == 0)
subtitle: This may have inflationary effects.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 and not rubicon : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if advisor_action_timer > 0 and rubicon : [+ advisor_action_timer +] weeks before next emergency fundraising. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; resources += 10; inflation += 1; data_miner_detected = 1; ip_grabber = 1

We have gained +10 resources.

@stimulation
title: Toggle Stimulation.
view-if: achievement_moly
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.stimulation) {
    Q.stimulation = 0;
} else {
    Q.stimulation = 1;
}
!}

Ok.

@snap_election
title: Snap Election
subtitle: Call a snap election.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if chancellor != "Besteiro" and president != "Besteiro" : Besteiro must head the government or hold the presidency. ?][? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer == 0 and (chancellor == "Besteiro" or president == "Besteiro")
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; time_to_election = 3
call: set_next_election_time

We have called for new elections, set for [+ next_election_month : month +] [+ next_election_year +].
